{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1272744-thief-of-fate","id":1272744,"title":"Thief of Fate","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-03T19:02:33-08:00","id":1272744,"title":"Thief of Fate","content":"Do you gain a beat if you are a victim of Thief of Fate and get a dramatic Failure?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-03T20:49:23-08:00","id":1272763,"title":"","content":"I'd say no. Since the beat comes from voluntarily turning a failure into a dramatic failure, as the someone who's been a victim of Thief of Fate doesn't get the option to have their failures not be dramatic failures that day they gain no beats from it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-03T22:40:27-08:00","id":1272784,"title":"","content":"You get a beat for voluntarily accepting a dramatic failure. You don't get a beat just for dramatically failing. If, for example, a penalty reduces your dice pool to a chance die, and you roll a 1 and suffer dramatic failure, you don't get a beat for that.<br /> <br /> Same deal here: no beat. The voluntary beat is offering a carrot. In this scenario, you're just getting hit with a stick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}